{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"函数域"},0],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"函数域"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>函数域是指 (有限域 $\\mathbb{F}_q$ 上) 不可约曲线的有理函数域.</p>\n<p>最简单的函数域是 $\\mathbb{A^1}$ 上的有理函数域 $\\mathbb{F}_q(t)$. 每个函数域都是 $\\mathbb{F}_q(t)$ 的有限扩张.</p>\n<p>每个函数域对应于唯一的光滑, 射影, 几何不可约 (geometrically irreducible) 曲线. 例如, $\\mathbb{F}_q(t)$ 对应 $\\mathbb{P}^1$.</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"位","text":"位"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"整体域","text":"整体域"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"函数域类比","text":"函数域类比"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"Frobenius态射","text":"Frobenius 态射"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}